{"id":"40de677e4faaffa1","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-guessing.md","title":"Guessing","display":"df-guessing — Guessing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-guessing","aliases":["58-df-guessing","Guessing"],"display":"df-guessing — Guessing","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-guessing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-guessing</span><span>Guessing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-guessing — Guessing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A\\in V\">\\(\\vec A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guessing}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Guessing}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\vec A:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:A_\\alpha=A\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\vec A:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:A_\\alpha=A\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Guessing}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Guessing}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is diamond-style initial-segment guessing.</li>\n<li>A single fixed function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat f:S\\to\\kappa\">\\(\\hat f:S\\to\\kappa\\)</span> cannot agree stationarily with every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\kappa\\to\\kappa\">\\(f:\\kappa\\to\\kappa\\)</span>: define <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\alpha)\\neq\\hat f(\\alpha)\">\\(f(\\alpha)\\neq\\hat f(\\alpha)\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>. The former predicate therefore collapsed to false.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guessing}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\vec A:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:A_\\alpha=A\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}guessing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Guessing}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S(\\vec A,S,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\hat f:S\\to\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\kappa\\to\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\alpha)\\neq\\hat f(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"02f7b20d69eccb99","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\vec A=(A_\\alpha)_{\\alpha<\\kappa}$ (guessing sequence, see [[../batch10/58-df-guessing.md]])"},{"id":"5d00fb89d36e20b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DiamondSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (stationary-set diamond sequence, see [[58-df-guessing]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-600","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-guessing.md|58-df-guessing]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["b802c3dd76418d95","36d7463d215be751"]}